# rLib embedded subset

Roth UI embeds only:

- `core.lua` — namespace/basic helpers;
- `snapguides.lua` — snap-guide support for addon-owned movers;
- `dragframe.lua` — the temporary drag worker.

The legacy frame-fader, grid and slash-command modules are retired. Combat fading is owned by `core/combat_fader.lua`; mover-grid and commands are owned by Roth UI core modules.
